@startuml
' Golden sample: login sequence diagram (Story 3.1)
actor User
participant "Web App" as App
participant "Auth API" as Api
participant Database as DB

User -> App: enter credentials
activate App
App -> Api: POST /login
activate Api
Api -> DB: SELECT user
DB --> Api: user row
alt valid password
    Api --> App: 200 token
else invalid password
    Api --> App: 401 unauthorized
end
deactivate Api
App --> User: show result
deactivate App
@enduml
